  "purpose": "Exact worker-facing neutral multi-source web-evidence dossier shape shared with canonical ingress validation, including profile-agnostic downstream-purpose coverage attestation, content-complete compatibility binding, and auditable physical player-feedback identity/count support.",
  "unknown_fields_policy": "top_level_and_observation_extras_remain_permissive_but_raw_body_like_and_personal_or_commercial_fields_are_forbidden;provenance_source_and_player_feedback_record_records_are_strict",
  "compact_provenance_policy_source": "TASTE-STEAM-REVIEW-DOSSIER-WEB-EVIDENCE-CONTRACT-V2#compact_provenance",
